{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03968","headline":"奉和幸长安故城未央宫应制 · 刘宪","name":"奉和幸长安故城未央宫应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汉宫千祀外，轩驾一来游。\n夷荡长如此，威灵不复留。\n凭高睿赏发，怀古圣情周。\n寒向南山歛，春过北渭浮。\n土功昔云盛，人英今所求。\n幸听熏风曲，方知霸道羞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘宪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03968.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03968","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}